From 10bf582f64079996effe586bd2dc759cdeeb6f4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ren=C3=A9=20Dudfield?= <renedudfield@microsoft.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 20:57:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] app: frontend: wait for confirmed backend port
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Delay desktop startup until the backend token and selected port are ready.
This prevents one OS user from connecting to another user’s backend.
